        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC40, Extra Heavy Duty Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor doors weighing 55 to 330 lbs, Deltana's Extra Heavy Duty Door Closer comes standard with an adjustable back-check function. It has an adjustable closing and latching speed. It comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast iron body with a forged steel arm. Available in your choice of 3 painted finish colors: aluminum, dark bronze or gold. Universal application: non-handed for standard, top-jamb or parallel arm installation. Optional hold open arm or cushion arm are available.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4041_closer_dimensions.gif?v=1704352994\" width=\"369\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 4041 Door Closer Mounting Holes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available DC40 Door Closer Accessories:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4041-series-door-closer-drop-plate-dp4041s\">Drop Plate for Standard Arm</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4041-series-door-closer-parallel-mount-drop-plate-dp4041p\">Drop Plate for Parallel Arm</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/deltana-door-closer-sex-bolts-dcsb175\">2-1/4\" Sex Bolts</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table with=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grade 1 Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check.</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated for 3 hours. R27405 UL Listed 47V5</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A 156.4 Grade 1 Certified.</li>\r\n<li>R27405 UL Listed 47V5</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant: meets ANSI A 117.1 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast iron body with a forged steel arm.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Cast Iron Closer Body</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Extra Heavy Duty Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Door Weight: 55 - 330 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 11-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable 1-6</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC4041.pdf?v=1691095332\" target=\"new\"><b>Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC40-install.pdf?v=1691095338\" target=\"new\">Deltana DC40 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<table width=\"600\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\" span=\"text\">\r\n<span class=\"text\"><b>Available Options</b></span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"300\" align=\"center\">\r\n\r\n<span class=\"text\"><b>DCHA-4041 Hold Open Arm</b></span>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/dc4041-arm.jpg?v=1704354676\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DCHA-4041 Hold Open Arm\">\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"300\" align=\"center\">\r\n<span class=\"text\"><b><b>DCCA-4041 Cushion Arm</b></span>\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-dc4010-coshionarm.jpg?v=1704354676\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DCCA-4041 Cushion Arm\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
